<title>GERMANY: Duerr - lost 17.96 mln dmk in Brazil in 1996.</title>
<headline>Duerr - lost 17.96 mln dmk in Brazil in 1996.</headline>
<dateline>BIETIGHEIM-BISSINGEN, Germany 1997-05-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>German plant manufacturer Duerr AG said on Tuesday that its 1996 results included a 17.96 million mark loss in Brazil.</p>
<p>The company earlier reported pre-tax profits for 1996 fell 18 percent at 36.2 million marks.</p>
</text>
